# Credentials used by this project. Copy nothing from here - these are names only.
#
# The OpenRouter key is read, in order, from:
#   1. $OPENROUTER_API_KEY in the environment
#   2. ~/AppData/Local/hermes/profiles/engineer/.env  (Hermes profile secret store)
# It is never read from a file inside this repository, and no key is committed.
#
# This project also works fully offline: `local_tts.py` (Windows SAPI, Piper) needs no
# key at all, and `tts.py verify` is the only cloud call used for QA.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
